Subject: [PATCH 09/13] advisors: the month scans in ascending building id (B3
 fix round)

verify-a minor 4 (pre-existing). rt.plopped and rt.growables are in the running game's order (its
swap-removes reorder them) and in Map order after a load, so the facility scan's lists and civicFirst,
the outage scan's place among equally occupied buildings, and the bus-stop place could differ between a
game and its loaded copy. A1 predicts the tick's "Show me" places from these scans. scanFacilities now
sorts its id lists and takes the lowest unpowered civic id; scanOutages and the bus-stop lookup take the
lowest id among equals. Only an advice's place changes, only among equals or after a removal, and no sim
system reads it.

Test: tests/sim/advisorsScanOrder.test.ts (a game after swap-removes and its loaded copy scan the same).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
